<!doctype html>
<html lang="ja">
<meta charset="utf-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
<title>JEPA を BP で学ぶ</title>
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
<link rel="stylesheet" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=IBM+Plex+Mono:wght@400;500&family=Zen+Kaku+Gothic+New:wght@400;500;700;900&display=swap">
<style>
/* Layout: one reading column of about 46em; figures widen to 60em. */
:root {
  --bg: #f3f5f8;
  --panel: #ffffff;
  --ink: #13171e;
  --ink-2: #4b5462;
  --ink-3: #6f7886;
  --rule: #d7dce4;
  --grid: #e6e9ee;
  --accent: #2a78d6;
  --monitor: #0d1015;
  --monitor-ink: #c9d1dc;
  --s1: #2a78d6;
  --s2: #eb6834;
  --s3: #1baf7a;
  --s4: #eda100;
  --neutral: #9aa3af;
  --good: #0a7d0a;
  --bad: #c03434;
  --warn: #9a6400;
  --good-bg: #e3f3e3;
  --bad-bg: #fbe5e5;
  --warn-bg: #fbf0d9;
  --font-display: "Zen Kaku Gothic New", "Hiragino Sans", "Noto Sans JP", sans-serif;
  --font-body: "Zen Kaku Gothic New", "Hiragino Sans", "Noto Sans JP", "Yu Gothic", sans-serif;
  --font-mono: "IBM Plex Mono", ui-monospace, "SFMono-Regular", Menlo, monospace;
}
@media (prefers-color-scheme: dark) {
  :root:not([data-theme="light"]) {
    --bg: #111418; --panel: #181c22; --ink: #e8ebef; --ink-2: #b3bac5; --ink-3: #8b94a1;
    --rule: #2b313a; --grid: #232830; --accent: #3987e5; --monitor: #07090c; --monitor-ink: #c9d1dc;
    --s1: #3987e5; --s2: #d95926; --s3: #199e70; --s4: #c98500; --neutral: #6c7582;
    --good: #4cc24c; --bad: #ec6b6b; --warn: #e0a23a;
    --good-bg: #16301a; --bad-bg: #3a1c1c; --warn-bg: #3a2c12;
    color-scheme: dark;
  }
}
:root[data-theme="dark"] {
  --bg: #111418; --panel: #181c22; --ink: #e8ebef; --ink-2: #b3bac5; --ink-3: #8b94a1;
  --rule: #2b313a; --grid: #232830; --accent: #3987e5; --monitor: #07090c; --monitor-ink: #c9d1dc;
  --s1: #3987e5; --s2: #d95926; --s3: #199e70; --s4: #c98500; --neutral: #6c7582;
  --good: #4cc24c; --bad: #ec6b6b; --warn: #e0a23a;
  --good-bg: #16301a; --bad-bg: #3a1c1c; --warn-bg: #3a2c12;
  color-scheme: dark;
}
* { box-sizing: border-box; }
body {
  background: var(--bg); color: var(--ink);
  font-family: var(--font-body); font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.85;
  padding-left: max(16px, env(safe-area-inset-left, 0px));
  padding-right: max(16px, env(safe-area-inset-right, 0px));
  padding-block: 0 72px;
  -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;
}
main { max-width: 60rem; margin: 0 auto; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 64px; }
.col { max-width: 46rem; }
h1, h2, h3 { font-family: var(--font-display); text-wrap: balance; line-height: 1.35; margin: 0; }
h1 { font-weight: 900; font-size: clamp(1.9rem, 5vw, 2.8rem); letter-spacing: 0.01em; }
h2 { font-weight: 900; font-size: 1.55rem; }
h3 { font-weight: 700; font-size: 1.1rem; }
p { margin: 0; }
code, .mono { font-family: var(--font-mono); font-size: 0.88em; }
code { background: var(--grid); padding: 0.05em 0.35em; border-radius: 3px; }
.num { font-family: var(--font-mono); font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; }
section { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 20px; }
.eyebrow { font-family: var(--font-mono); font-size: 0.78rem; letter-spacing: 0.08em; color: var(--ink-3); text-transform: uppercase; }
.sec-head { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 6px; border-top: 2px solid var(--ink); padding-top: 14px; }
.prose { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 14px; max-width: 46rem; }
.prose ul, .prose ol { margin: 0; padding-left: 1.3em; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 6px; }
.muted { color: var(--ink-2); }
.small { font-size: 0.88rem; }

header.hero { padding-top: 48px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 18px; }
.hero .lead { font-size: 1.12rem; max-width: 44rem; color: var(--ink-2); }
.meta { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 6px 22px; font-family: var(--font-mono); font-size: 0.8rem; color: var(--ink-3); }
.meta span b { color: var(--ink-2); font-weight: 500; }
nav.toc { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 6px 16px; font-size: 0.9rem; }
nav.toc a { color: var(--accent); text-decoration: none; }
nav.toc a:hover, nav.toc a:focus-visible { text-decoration: underline; }

.findings { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(16rem, 1fr)); gap: 14px; }
.finding { background: var(--panel); border: 1px solid var(--rule); border-radius: 6px; padding: 18px 20px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 8px; min-width: 0; }
.finding .k { font-family: var(--font-mono); font-size: 0.75rem; color: var(--ink-3); letter-spacing: 0.06em; }

figure { margin: 0; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 10px; min-width: 0; }
figcaption { font-size: 0.86rem; color: var(--ink-2); line-height: 1.7; max-width: 46rem; }
.fig-title { font-weight: 700; font-size: 0.95rem; }
.chart { width: 100%; overflow-x: auto; }
.chart svg { display: block; width: 100%; height: auto; overflow: visible; }
.chart text { font-family: var(--font-mono); fill: var(--ink-3); }
.legend { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 4px 16px; font-size: 0.84rem; color: var(--ink-2); }
.legend i { display: inline-block; width: 16px; height: 3px; border-radius: 2px; vertical-align: middle; margin-right: 6px; }
.legend i.dot { width: 9px; height: 9px; border-radius: 50%; }
.duo { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(17rem, 1fr)); gap: 22px; }
.duo > * { min-width: 0; }

/* the video monitor */
.monitor { background: var(--monitor); color: var(--monitor-ink); border-radius: 8px; padding: 18px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 14px; }
.screens { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 18px; align-items: flex-start; }
.screen { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 6px; }
.screen .lab { font-family: var(--font-mono); font-size: 0.74rem; letter-spacing: 0.05em; color: #8e98a6; }
.screen canvas { width: 208px; height: 208px; max-width: 100%; border: 1px solid #27303b; display: block; }
#pix { image-rendering: pixelated; }
.readout { font-family: var(--font-mono); font-size: 0.8rem; line-height: 1.75; color: #aeb8c5; display: flex; flex-direction: column; min-width: 12rem; }
.readout b { color: #eef2f6; font-weight: 500; }
.controls { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 8px; align-items: center; }
.controls button { font: inherit; font-size: 0.84rem; background: #1b222b; color: #dbe2ea; border: 1px solid #343e4b; border-radius: 4px; padding: 5px 12px; cursor: pointer; }
.controls button[aria-pressed="true"] { background: #2a78d6; border-color: #2a78d6; color: #fff; }
.controls button:focus-visible, .controls input:focus-visible { outline: 2px solid #86b6ef; outline-offset: 2px; }
.controls input[type=range] { flex: 1 1 10rem; accent-color: #3987e5; }
.strip svg text { font-family: var(--font-mono); fill: #8e98a6; }

/* timeline */
ol.timeline { list-style: none; margin: 0; padding: 0; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 0; max-width: 46rem; }
ol.timeline li { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 6.5rem 1fr; gap: 14px; padding: 12px 0; border-top: 1px solid var(--rule); }
ol.timeline li:last-child { border-bottom: 1px solid var(--rule); }
ol.timeline .when { font-family: var(--font-mono); font-size: 0.82rem; color: var(--ink-3); padding-top: 3px; }
ol.timeline .what { min-width: 0; }

/* tables */
.tablewrap { overflow-x: auto; }
table { border-collapse: collapse; font-size: 0.88rem; width: 100%; }
th, td { text-align: left; padding: 8px 10px; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--rule); vertical-align: top; }
th { font-weight: 700; color: var(--ink-2); font-size: 0.8rem; }
td.num, th.num { text-align: right; }
.chip { display: inline-block; font-size: 0.78rem; font-weight: 700; padding: 1px 8px; border-radius: 999px; white-space: nowrap; }
.chip.ok { background: var(--good-bg); color: var(--good); }
.chip.ng { background: var(--bad-bg); color: var(--bad); }
.chip.mid { background: var(--warn-bg); color: var(--warn); }

/* status matrix */
.matrix td, .matrix th { text-align: center; }
.matrix th:first-child, .matrix td:first-child { text-align: left; }

/* dot plot */
.dots { display: flex; flex-direction: column; }
.dots .row { display: grid; grid-template-columns: minmax(7rem, 12rem) 1fr 1fr; gap: 12px; align-items: center; min-height: 30px; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--grid); }
.dots .row.head { border-bottom: 1px solid var(--rule); min-height: 0; padding-bottom: 6px; align-items: end; }
.dots .row.group { border-bottom: none; padding-top: 12px; min-height: 0; }
.dots .group span { font-family: var(--font-mono); font-size: 0.72rem; color: var(--ink-3); letter-spacing: 0.06em; }
.dots .name { font-size: 0.84rem; line-height: 1.35; min-width: 0; }
.dots .track { position: relative; height: 26px; min-width: 0; }
.dots .track svg { width: 100%; height: 26px; display: block; overflow: visible; }
.dots .axis { position: relative; height: 34px; font-family: var(--font-mono); font-size: 0.7rem; color: var(--ink-3); }
.dots .axis span { position: absolute; bottom: 0; transform: translateX(-50%); white-space: nowrap; }
.dots .axis .t { bottom: 16px; font-family: var(--font-body); font-size: 0.78rem; color: var(--ink-2); font-weight: 700; transform: none; left: 0; }
.dots .fail { font-size: 0.76rem; color: var(--bad); font-weight: 700; line-height: 26px; }

.tiles { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(14rem, 1fr)); gap: 14px; }
.tile { background: var(--panel); border: 1px solid var(--rule); border-radius: 6px; padding: 16px 18px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; }
.tile .big { font-family: var(--font-mono); font-size: 1.7rem; font-weight: 500; font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; }
.tile .sub { font-size: 0.84rem; color: var(--ink-2); }

dl.terms { display: grid; grid-template-columns: minmax(7rem, 9rem) 1fr; gap: 10px 18px; margin: 0; max-width: 46rem; }
dl.terms dt { font-family: var(--font-mono); font-size: 0.86rem; font-weight: 500; padding-top: 2px; }
dl.terms dd { margin: 0; min-width: 0; }

.diagram svg { display: block; width: 100%; height: auto; max-width: 46rem; }
.diagram text { font-family: var(--font-body); fill: var(--ink); }
.diagram .m { font-family: var(--font-mono); fill: var(--ink-3); }

#tip { position: fixed; pointer-events: none; z-index: 20; background: var(--panel); color: var(--ink); border: 1px solid var(--rule); border-radius: 4px; padding: 6px 9px; font-family: var(--font-mono); font-size: 0.74rem; line-height: 1.55; box-shadow: 0 4px 14px rgba(0,0,0,0.12); max-width: 18rem; }
pre.cmd { background: var(--panel); border: 1px solid var(--rule); border-radius: 6px; padding: 12px 14px; overflow-x: auto; font-family: var(--font-mono); font-size: 0.8rem; line-height: 1.7; margin: 0; }
@media (max-width: 560px) {
  ol.timeline li { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 2px; }
  dl.terms { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 2px 0; }
  dl.terms dd { margin-bottom: 10px; }
  .dots .row { grid-template-columns: 5.5rem 1fr 1fr; gap: 8px; }
}
@media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) { * { scroll-behavior: auto !important; } }
/* additions for exp/vision: the optimizer colors (SGD s1, momentum s2, RMSProp s3, AdamW s4) */
:root { --s4: #6250d6; --shade: rgba(42, 120, 214, 0.07); --n-in: #eef1f5; --n-enc: #e3eefb; --n-lat: #fbeedd; --n-dec: #e2f4ec; --n-out: #e2f4ec; }
@media (prefers-color-scheme: dark) {
  :root:not([data-theme="light"]) { --s4: #8a7cf0; --shade: rgba(57, 135, 229, 0.12); --n-in: #20252c; --n-enc: #1b2a3d; --n-lat: #3a2c18; --n-dec: #17332a; --n-out: #17332a; }
}
:root[data-theme="dark"] { --s4: #8a7cf0; --shade: rgba(57, 135, 229, 0.12); --n-in: #20252c; --n-enc: #1b2a3d; --n-lat: #3a2c18; --n-dec: #17332a; --n-out: #17332a; }
.chart text, .diagram text { fill: var(--ink-2); font-family: var(--font-mono); }
.chart text.lbl, .diagram text.lbl { fill: var(--ink-3); font-family: var(--font-body); }
.diagram text { font-family: var(--font-body); fill: var(--ink); }
.diagram text.m { font-family: var(--font-body); fill: var(--ink-3); }
.legend { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 4px 16px; font-size: 0.8rem; color: var(--ink-2); margin-bottom: 4px; }
.legend span { display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 6px; }
.legend svg { flex: none; }
h3.subhead { margin-top: 12px; }

/* images with row labels */
.recon { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 7.5rem 1fr; gap: 10px; align-items: stretch; }
.recon .rows { display: grid; grid-template-rows: repeat(3, 1fr); font-size: 0.78rem; color: var(--ink-2); line-height: 1.35; }
.recon .rows span { display: flex; align-items: center; border-top: 1px solid var(--rule); }
.recon .rows span:first-child { border-top: none; }
.recon img, .strip-row img { width: 100%; height: auto; display: block; border-radius: 3px; min-width: 0; }
.strips { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 10px; }
.strip-row { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 7.5rem 1fr; gap: 10px; align-items: center; }
.strip-row .lab { font-size: 0.84rem; font-weight: 700; line-height: 1.4; }

/* segmented buttons and the slider */
.seg { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 6px; }
.seg button { font: inherit; font-size: 0.82rem; background: var(--panel); color: var(--ink-2); border: 1px solid var(--rule); border-radius: 999px; padding: 3px 12px; cursor: pointer; }
.seg button[aria-pressed="true"] { background: var(--accent); border-color: var(--accent); color: #fff; }
.seg button:focus-visible, .controls-row input:focus-visible { outline: 2px solid var(--accent); outline-offset: 2px; }
.controls-row { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 8px 14px; align-items: center; }
.controls-row input[type=range] { flex: 1 1 12rem; accent-color: var(--accent); }

/* dot plots: HTML dots on tracks */
.dots { overflow-x: auto; }
.dots .row { min-width: 34rem; }
.dots .track { position: relative; height: 26px; }
.dots .track .ref { position: absolute; top: 2px; bottom: 2px; border-left: 1px dashed var(--ink-3); }
.dots .dot { position: absolute; top: 50%; width: 12px; height: 12px; margin: -6px 0 0 -6px; border-radius: 50%; background: var(--c); border: 2px solid var(--c); cursor: default; }
.dots .dot.hollow { background: var(--panel); }
.dots .dot.out { border-radius: 2px; }
.dots .row > div:last-child { display: flex; align-items: center; }

details.full { max-width: 60rem; }
details.full summary { cursor: pointer; color: var(--accent); font-size: 0.92rem; }
details.full table { font-size: 0.78rem; }
details.full td, details.full th { padding: 6px 8px; white-space: nowrap; }
.prose ol { margin: 0; padding-left: 1.3em; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 6px; }
@media (max-width: 560px) {
  .recon, .strip-row { grid-template-columns: 4.6rem 1fr; gap: 6px; }
  .recon .rows { font-size: 0.66rem; }
}
.chart .legend svg { width: 22px; height: 10px; display: inline-block; overflow: visible; }
.dots .track, .dots .axis { margin: 0 14px; }
@media (max-width: 560px) { .chart svg { min-width: 540px; } }
/* column rules */
th + th, td + td { border-left: 1px solid var(--rule); }
table { border-top: 1px solid var(--rule); }
.dots .track, .dots .axis { position: relative; }
.dots .track::before, .dots .axis::before { content: ""; position: absolute; left: -8px; top: -3px; bottom: -3px; border-left: 1px solid var(--rule); }
.dots .row.head .axis::before { top: -6px; bottom: -7px; }
.dots .row > div:last-child { border-left: 1px solid var(--rule); padding-left: 8px; align-self: stretch; }
.dots .row.group > span { border: none; }
.grid15 { border-collapse: separate; border-spacing: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 34rem; }
.grid15 th { font-weight: 500; font-size: 0.82rem; color: var(--ink-2); text-align: center; background: none; border: 0; padding: 2px; }
.grid15 td { border: 1px solid var(--rule); border-radius: 6px; padding: 6px 4px; text-align: center; vertical-align: middle; line-height: 1.35; }
.grid15 td .s { font-family: var(--font-mono); font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; font-size: 0.98rem; font-weight: 500; }
.grid15 td .z { font-family: var(--font-mono); font-size: 0.74rem; color: var(--ink-2); display: block; }
.grid15 td .v { font-size: 0.72rem; display: block; }
.grid15 td.ok { outline: 2.5px solid var(--good); outline-offset: -2px; }
.scatter svg { width: 100%; height: auto; display: block; }
.pair { display: grid; grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr) minmax(0, 1fr); gap: 16px; }
@media (max-width: 760px) { .pair { grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr); } }
</style>
<style>
.recon { grid-template-columns: 7.5rem 1fr; }
.chunkfig text { font-family: var(--font-body); fill: var(--ink); font-size: 13px; }
.chunkfig text.m { fill: var(--ink-3); font-size: 12px; }
.chart .legend svg { min-width: 0; }
</style>
<style>
.plan td:first-child { font-family: var(--font-mono); font-weight: 500; white-space: nowrap; }
.plan tr.done td { background: none; }
.plan tr.now td { background: var(--warn-bg); }
.cell { font-family: var(--font-mono); font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; }
.cell .chip { margin-left: 4px; }
.sweep td, .sweep th { text-align: center; white-space: nowrap; }
.sweep td:first-child, .sweep th:first-child { text-align: left; }
.jepafig text { font-family: var(--font-body); fill: var(--ink); font-size: 13px; }
.jepafig text.m { fill: var(--ink-3); font-size: 11.5px; }
.jepafig .box { stroke: var(--rule); stroke-width: 1; }
.jepafig .arrow { stroke: var(--ink-3); stroke-width: 1.4; fill: none; marker-end: url(#ah); }
.quad { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr)); gap: 22px; }
@media (max-width: 760px) { .quad { grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr); } }
.findings { grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(20rem, 1fr)); }
.tablewrap > table { min-width: 36rem; }
.quad > * { min-width: 0; }
.recon { grid-template-columns: 7.5rem 1fr; }
.recon .rows { grid-template-rows: repeat(2, 1fr); }
/* V18c: lambda colors (0.5, 0.8, 0.95); the learning rate is the dash */
:root { --l5: #b8337a; --l8: #0b7f8c; --l95: #806000; }
@media (prefers-color-scheme: dark) {
  :root:not([data-theme="light"]) { --l5: #e06aa9; --l8: #2bb3c0; --l95: #c9a227; }
}
:root[data-theme="dark"] { --l5: #e06aa9; --l8: #2bb3c0; --l95: #c9a227; }
.figimg { width: 100%; max-width: 46rem; height: auto; display: block; border-radius: 3px; }
.sweep .cell { white-space: nowrap; }
#t-s-old td, #t-s-old th { white-space: nowrap; }
.jepafig .arrow8 { marker-end: url(#ah8); }
.callout { max-width: 46rem; background: var(--warn-bg); border-left: 4px solid var(--warn); border-radius: 0 6px 6px 0; padding: 12px 16px; }
.ob { text-decoration: overline; }
</style>
<body>
<main>
<header class="hero">
  <div class="eyebrow">mujou-exp · exp/vision · V18・V18b・V18c · 2026-11-23〜26</div>
  <h1>誤差逆伝播と i.i.d. なミニバッチで、JEPA は何を学び、それをどう測れるか</h1>
  <p class="lead">V17 までに、同じ ViT で VAE を学べることを、普通の学習でもストリームの PC-ALM でも確かめました。この資料は、検証の対象を JEPA に移した最初の 3 段（V18・V18b・V18c）の結果です。誤差逆伝播（BP）と i.i.d. なミニバッチという最も素直な条件で、JEPA が崩壊せずに学べるか、学んだ表現をどう測ればよいかを調べました。V18c では主の指標を 3 回作りましたが、どれも有効性の確かめで外れました。そのため V18c で判定したのは崩壊しないこと（L1）だけで、自分の表現空間での補完の同定は記述として並べます。符号の空間で時間の流れがどれだけ真っすぐか（時間の線形性と情報の幅）も、記述として並べます。最後に、ここまでの計画と、これからの進め方をまとめます。</p>
  <div class="meta">
    <span><b>学習則</b> BP + AdamW（参照の条件）</span>
    <span><b>mujou</b> 5aa3773</span>
    <span><b>モデル</b> ViT-S・幅 1024・μP・early fusion（パッチ 16・4・8）</span>
    <span><b>run</b> 掃引 18 + 33 + 15 本、長い run 4 + 4 + 12 本</span>
    <span><b>PR</b> Geson-anko/mujou-exp#33</span>
    <span><b>計算</b> RTX 4090 × 4、RTX 4060 × 4、RTX 5070 Ti</span>
